# Drag the 8 MHz crystal (Y1) out of the schematic and drop it below the sheet.
# Exercises the whole held-button path: hit-test on press, drag-continue across
# many polls, drop on release. Before the 0xE1 level fix this was impossible --
# the button read as released on every poll after the press, so the part never
# moved and the app re-fired select-start on every mouse move instead.

boot 8000
drag 327 366 327 620 20
settle 1200
